    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Recently refurbished modernized town house, situated in the heart of the town, within walking distance of all town centre amenities. \r\nThe property which  is being sold turn key finished, offers  bright  modern accommodation and briefly comprises \r\nEntrance Hall, Bedroom, Living Room, Kitchen and Bathroom. \r\nThere are 2 bedrooms on 1st floor, together with family bathroom. Outside there is an enclosed outdoor space.\r\nThe property which is recently refurbished is presented as walk in condition, with underfloor heating on the ground floor and \r\noffers a convenient and excellent location with Dundalk being equidistant from Dublin and Belfast. The property is within a Short Drive of M1 motorway with rail and bus services close by.\r\nThe sale of 14 St Marys Road offers an ideal opportunity to acquire an attractive home in the heart of a vibrant and historical town rich in amenities and offering excellent commuting links, Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 5.79m x 0.937m \r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nBedroom - 4.757m x 3.092m \r\nTiled Floor \nWardbrobe\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.611m x 3.092m \r\nPatio Doors to rear outdoor space\r\n\r\nKitchen - 3.154m x 1.57m \r\nFitted Presses\nIntegrated oven and hob\nFridge\nTiled Splashback \r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.748m x 2.127m \r\nFully Tiled\nWc, Wcb, Shower\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 3.923m x 2.98m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.21m x 3.252m \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.722m x 2.162m \r\nFully Tiled\nWc. Wcb, Shower\r\n\r\nOutside - \r\nEnclosed outdoor space \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Modernised and recently refurbished .\r\nUnderfloor Heating on ground floor.\r\nA conveniently located Town House with excellent transport links to Dublin and Belfast only 50 minutes from Dublin Airport, with Dundalk offering an abundance of Leisure, Retail Hospitality and outdoor amenities."
      },
